; FLSUN V400 PETG MAX VOLUMETRIC FLOW CALIBRATION
; Nozzle: 0.4 mm | Filament: PETG 1.75 mm
; Flow range: 5.0 to 20.0 mm^3/s | Step: 0.5 mm^3/s per 1.0 mm
; Tower: 40 x 40 mm single wall | Layer: 0.20 mm | Line width: 0.45 mm
; Stop the print when extrusion first becomes rough, matte, sparse, or starts skipping.
; Recommended result: last clean flow value minus 10 percent.
;
M140 S85 ; begin heating bed
M104 S150 ; anti-ooze homing temperature
M106 S0
G90
M83
PRINT_START ; G28 and load saved default bed mesh
M190 S85 ; wait for PETG bed temperature
M109 S240 ; wait for PETG nozzle temperature
SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT VELOCITY=400 ACCEL=3500 ACCEL_TO_DECEL=2500
SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT SQUARE_CORNER_VELOCITY=5
SET_PRESSURE_ADVANCE ADVANCE=0.020 SMOOTH_TIME=0.040
G92 E0
G0 Z5 F1800
G0 X-50 Y-35 F12000
G0 Z0.220 F900
G1 X50 Y-35 E4.57327 F1500 ; prime line
G1 E-0.8 F1800
G0 X-22.5 Y-22.5 F12000
G1 E0.8 F1800
